  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Cook opt 03 \u2014 CHOPs\n\nWindow title: \"03 chops\". Green traces. Left to right, top row then bottom.\nWait about 2 seconds before judging cells 5 and 8.\n\n1 ExpressionCHOP sin(t + i * 0.15). A wave that TRAVELS.\n2 ExpressionCHOP 0.5. A FLAT line, above the middle. It must not travel.\n3 NoiseCHOP speed 0, trailed. A FLAT trace.\n4 NoiseCHOP speed 2, trailed. A trace that KEEPS wandering.\n5 Sine into HoldCHOP (hold on start, no trigger), trailed. FLAT line near 0.6. It must not follow the sine.\n6 Constant 0.8 into Lag. The trace RISES and then goes FLAT near the top. It must not stay on the floor, and it must not keep wiggling after it arrives.\n7 SelectCHOP named expr_live. No wire. Same TRAVELING wave as cell 1. Not empty.\n8 The same sine into Lag. The trace KEEPS moving. A lag on a moving input must not freeze.\n\nFilterCHOP and SmoothCHOP use this same settle as Lag. Cell 6 is the check for that family.\nFail if a live trace freezes, a still trace wanders, Hold follows the sine, or Select is empty.",
      "position": [
        -40,
        -280
      ],
      "size": [
        720,
        340
      ],
      "color": [
        1.0,
        0.95,
        0.55,
        0.92
      ]
    }
  ]
